{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/9768a85043b7df564b12960284d23fd4.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>You are a simple young man from the suburbs with an ambitious vision to revolutionize the tech industry forever. Start in your parent s\u2019 garage, visit the university to hire the most motivated students of different professions and buy equipment to make it the best startup workplace. Shine it up to be the best startup workplace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/04f059dc7d94e0e17f90fb081887e165.poster.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/04f059dc7d94e0e17f90fb081887e165.webm?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/04f059dc7d94e0e17f90fb081887e165.mp4?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scout for potential hires in diverse settings, with a keen eye on university campuses, to recruit top talent. Each team member you bring on board will contribute unique skills and strengths, making your strategic approach to team assembly and management crucial to your venture's growth and success in a competitive economic landscape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/cfe2622f5872c6cb0e47aa3c6b19e03c.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=144 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/46a1dc8108c3a34fa199a3135af9fb1a.poster.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/46a1dc8108c3a34fa199a3135af9fb1a.webm?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/46a1dc8108c3a34fa199a3135af9fb1a.mp4?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the brainstorming mini-game, where you and your team come together to think up new product ideas. It's a simple yet engaging way to mix everyone's ideas and skills to create something new. Through this creative collaboration, you'll develop extraordinary products.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/99eaccf33819f2681f912dff67811fce.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=144 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/065a5ba6f90af493d38099af64610f09.poster.avif?t=1726472469\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/065a5ba6f90af493d38099af64610f09.webm?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/065a5ba6f90af493d38099af64610f09.mp4?t=1726472469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Assign tasks to your team based on their skills. This ensures everyone is working on what they do best, boosting efficiency and project success. It's a practical approach to steer your business smoothly towards its objectives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837540/extras/3f12f5a7b1faa61ccede6f5b50628cd8.poster.a